  What it means concretely:

  - [38;5;153musers.notes[39m holds data for all 48,000 production rows per the README. [38;5;153mALTER TABLE users DROP COLUMN notes[39m deletes
    that content permanently at deploy time.
  - There is no down/rollback migration in this repo — [38;5;153mmigrations/[39m is forward-only, applied in order by the deploy job.
